{"id": "r-a-smalltalk-1", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:smalltalk"], "template": "not much. working with my hands, best kind of thinking"}
{"id": "r-a-smalltalk-2", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:smalltalk"], "template": "same as ever. coffee, a project, and opinions"}
{"id": "r-a-smalltalk-3", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:smalltalk"], "template": "quiet one. i like quiet, gives a man room to think"}
{"id": "r-a-smalltalk-4", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:smalltalk"], "template": "plugging away. you?"}
{"id": "r-a-smalltalk-5", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:smalltalk"], "template": "sharpening tools and sharpening arguments, you know me"}
{"id": "r-a-comfort-1", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:comfort"], "template": "hey. look at me. you're gonna be all right, and i'll be right here while you find out"}
{"id": "r-a-comfort-2", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:comfort"], "template": "that's a real worry and it's allowed. so what's the first small thing we can do"}
{"id": "r-a-comfort-3", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:comfort"], "template": "you're not the first to feel that and you won't be the last. doesn't make it smaller. i've got you"}
{"id": "r-a-comfort-4", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:comfort"], "template": "courage isn't the absence of nerves {speaker}. it's doing it anyway, and you've done harder"}
{"id": "r-a-comfort-5", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:comfort"], "template": "steady. breathe. one step at a time, i'm not going anywhere"}
{"id": "r-a-comfort-6", "character": "friend-a", "tags": ["social:comfort"], "template": "come here. whatever it is, we'll face it together and we'll do it properly"}

